Third-party code
----------------

Zed
  palette/src/score.ts (normalizeActionQuery, humanizeActionName) and the test vectors in
  palette/test/score.test.ts are adapted from Zed's command palette
  (crates/command_palette/src/command_palette.rs, https://github.com/zed-industries/zed).
  Copyright Zed Industries, Inc. Licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 3 or
  later. Changed for pumi.

nucleo
  palette/src/nucleo.ts is a port of nucleo's fuzzy matcher,
  https://github.com/helix-editor/nucleo. Licensed under the Mozilla Public License, version 2.0;
  that file stays under the MPL-2.0 (https://mozilla.org/MPL/2.0/). Changed for pumi.

herdr and Heeler
  heeler/ ports code from herdr (https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr) and from Heeler's plugin
  (https://github.com/ZingerLittleBee/Heeler), both licensed under the Apache License, Version
  2.0 (https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0). Each ported file names its source in a
  PROVENANCE comment. Changed for pumi: written in TypeScript, against pumi's API.

